# Every invite code is served by the one built page at /join, which reads the
# code out of the address bar. A 200 rewrite rather than a redirect, so the code
# stays in the URL for the page to find and the link someone was sent is the
# link they stay on.
#
# The destination has to sit outside /invite/, or Cloudflare reads the rule as
# pointing at itself and drops it.
#
# Without this, Cloudflare Pages has no file at /invite/<code> and falls back to
# the landing page, which is the generic Get Scrollsy button with no invite in it.
/invite/* /join/ 200
